# Files in this repo that Fern's generated output must never overwrite.
#
# The generated SDK is rsynced onto the module root by the "Regenerate SDKs"
# workflow in WonderInventions/developer-ro-am. Everything listed here is
# hand-maintained and survives that sync; everything else is replaced wholesale.
#
# Paths are rsync --exclude patterns, matched from the repo root.

# Hand-written webhook signature verification, imported as ro.am/roamhq/webhooks.
#
# It is not generated because Fern's signature model cannot describe how a
# signing secret is encoded, and Roam's whsec_ secrets are base64 — see the
# header of webhooks/verify.go. It sits in its own package so that a
# regeneration structurally cannot delete it, rather than relying on this
# entry alone.
webhooks/

# Hand-written contract tests. HTTP is faked at Client.Do against the real
# default host; a regeneration that breaks pagination, retries, or
# Roam-Version must fail here rather than silently shipping.
tests/

# Guide samples copied in by CI for a compile check, never committed from
# that workflow. Kept here so a local copy cannot be deleted by --delete.
examples/
internal/guidesamples/

# Hand-written docs and legal.
README.md
LICENSE
CHANGELOG.md
AGENTS.md
RELEASING.md

# CI, repo metadata.
.github/
.gitignore
.fernignore
